500589|Report Category|The Client Communication - Benchmarks report displays all Accounts of the firm, any active Strategies within the Accounts Portfolio(s), and also the Index Package(s) assigned to the Portfolio(s).  House Accounts are excluded. This information can be used to validate the proper assignment of Index Packages prior to generating Statements.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Client Communication Benchmarks
