500589|Report Category|Audit - Client Characteristics report displays changes to basic Client information over a specified date range. Changes are grouped by category and subcategory and highlight the Who, What, When, and How (Add, Modify, Delete) of the changes. The intent is to provide the user insight into intraday static data changes made to Client attributes to support audit controls.|User|Read-Only|NEW Name:  BOXI - Audit - Client Characteristics
500589|Report Category|This report is used to track the timeliness of market order executions. The report captures the elapsed time taken to execute the orders. The clock starts when the order is entered into GWP and stops when the order has been filled. The report will also display cancelled orders including limit orders as well as executed limit orders. This report may take several minutes to execute due to the volume and historical nature of this report.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - UK regulatory - Granular Timely Execution Report
500589|Report Category|The Account Characteristics report is a generic report containing all information regarding accounts.  A user will use this report for many purposes, each of which are related the understanding characteristics regarding accounts.  The report is not intended to be used for account holdings or valuations.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Account Characteristics Report
