500589|Report Category|The Fee Approval report can be used to review periodic fee computations and collection activities for a firm.  The report has four tabs, the first for account computation activity, the second has the related account collection activities, the third is for Fee Group Computation information and the forth tab has Fee Group Collection activity.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Fee Approval Report
500589|Report Category|The Self Service feature for Reporting will allow ceratin users - (self service administartors) to create thier own reports from a Universe of objects. This template will be called the Fees template. it will allow such users to view and use this template to create thier own reports|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Self Service Fees Universe
