500740|Report Category|The Investment Compliance (IC) Cross Reference Report was created to show a user the assignment details regarding firm level created IC rules. If an IC rule needs to be modified or deleted after it is has been assigned, this information helps the user understand the impact of the potential change.  A user may select one or more IC rule(s) and the IC Cross Reference Report displays details such as assignment level (i.e. all accounts, by servicing relationship, by account type, or by portfolio type).|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Investment Compliance Cross Reference Report
