500677|Report Category|This report includes fee rebates calculated, fee rebates calculated but not posted due to an exception and fee rebates calculated and have one-time fees generated as part of the final fee computation process for periodic fees computed in advance. The report displays information at the collection activity level (portfolio level). If there are multiple exceptions for a rebate computed record, then a single exception is listed in the 'Rebate not issued reason' column based on the priority order for exceptions.|User|Read-Only|BOXI- Final Fees Rebate for Advance Periodic Computations report
500677|Report Category|A generic template for Self service - Client and Account Characteristics containing all information regarding Client, Account, Portfolio and Beneficiary. A user will use this template for the purpose of creating self service reports related to analyzing Client and Account Characteristics. The self service - Client and Account haracteristics is not intended to be used for account holdings or valuations.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Self Service Client and Account  CharactersitcsTemplate
