500678|Report Category|The Asset Exposure Firms and Sub-Firms report is a generic report containing all information regarding an accounts holding across a users book of business. This report allows a user retrieve data at the Sub-Firm level. A user will use this report for many purposes, each of which are related to finding account holders based on search characteristics. The report runs for all the assets in the selected Firm or Sub-Firm and could result in a long delay in retrieving report data.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Asset Exposure - Firms and Sub-Firms
