500598|Report Category|The Audit - Account Optional Fields Report will be used to report any audit additions and/or changes to account optional fields during a time frame for a specific user or list of users, for a specific account or list of accounts.  Note:  changes to 'Blank' or 'Null' values will be treated as a modification/change for purposes of the report. First time specification of a value for the optional field will be treated as an add.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Audit - Account Optional Fields Report
