500599|Report Category|Audit - Client Characteristics report displays changes to basic Client information over a specified date range. Changes are grouped by category and subcategory and highlight the Who, What, When, and How (Add, Modify, Delete) of the changes. The intent is to provide the user insight into intraday static data changes made to Client attributes to support audit controls.|User|Read-Only|NEW Name:  BOXI - Audit - Client Characteristics
