500579|Report Category|The Asset Characteristics - Held Assets report is a generic report containing all information regarding subscribed assets that have active positions.  A user will use this report for many purposes, each of which are related to understanding characteristics regarding assets.  Not applicable for ASP.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Asset Characteristics
500579|Report Category|This report is used to track the timeliness of market order executions. The report captures the elapsed time taken to execute the orders. The clock starts when the order is entered into GWP and stops when the order has been filled. The report will also display cancelled orders including limit orders as well as executed limit orders. This report may take several minutes to execute due to the volume and historical nature of this report.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - UK regulatory - Granular Timely Execution Report
500579|Report Category|The Account Characteristics report is a generic report containing all information regarding accounts.  A user will use this report for many purposes, each of which are related the understanding characteristics regarding accounts.  The report is not intended to be used for account holdings or valuations.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Account Characteristics Report
500579|Report Category|The Corporate Actions Events Completed Report displays all CA event types that have been executed over a specified date period. The report is intended to be used by SEI Operations to monitor corporate action payments that have been made over a given period, and to compare the date the event was executed with the market announced Payable Date in order to validate service level standards.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Corporate Action Events Report
