500589|Report Category|The ISA 14 Annual Statistical Return Boxi Report - provides ISA Managers with the information necessary to file their Stocks and Shares and Cash ISA Valuation of all amounts held under management in each specified type of qualifying investment in stocks and shares and cash ISAs.  Amounts on the Summary Report are rounded up to the nearest pound based on HMRC requirements. |User|Read-Only|BOXI - UK Tax HMRC ISA Plan Manager Reporting
