500610|Report Category|The Periodic Fee Computation Audit Report is primarily used to support the auditing of periodic fee computations to validate client consents for fee agreements. The report has two tabs: Account Computation and Fee Group Computation and the Computation Activity ID will have a hyperlink to open a new UI that will be a display of the Periodic Fee Computation.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Periodic Fee Computation Audit Report
