500676|Report Category|The Audit - Asset Characteristics report is used to identify securities which have had manual changes to one or more attributes within a user defined time period. It shows the old and new values, the date, time and name of the entity making the change.  Not applicable for ASP.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Audit - Asset Characteristics Report
500676|Report Category|The ISA 14 Annual Statistical Return Boxi Report - provides ISA Managers with the information necessary to file their Stocks and Shares and Cash ISA Valuation of all amounts held under management in each specified type of qualifying investment in stocks and shares and cash ISAs.  Amounts on the Summary Report are rounded up to the nearest pound based on HMRC requirements. |User|Read-Only|BOXI - UK Tax HMRC ISA Plan Manager Reporting
