500676|Report Category|Pledge report will be used for displaying all the pledge needs for the portfolio and the underlying pledged positions which make up for the required pledge. This report is a deviation report and the user can use this information to manage the pledge positions or the pledge amounts.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Pledge Report
