500571|Report Category|The U.K. Regulatory FCA Transaction Reconciliation(MiFIR)report details all transactions posted to SWP on a given day, and a determination if each transaction qualifies for reporting to the FCA. The report has been enhanced with new requirements to capture information like Investment Decision Maker where applicable and the person/system responsible for execution. The report also historically identifies if SWP successfully transmitted the transaction to FCA.(Most recent historical transactions view only)|User|Read-Only|BOXI-UK Regulatory-FCA Transaction Reconciliation (MiFIR) Report
