500603|Report Category|The Asset Characteristics - Held Assets report is a generic report containing all information regarding subscribed assets that have active positions.  A user will use this report for many purposes, each of which are related to understanding characteristics regarding assets.  Not applicable for ASP.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Asset Characteristics
500603|Report Category|This report is used to track the timeliness of market order executions. The report captures the elapsed time taken to execute the orders. The clock starts when the order is entered into GWP and stops when the order has been filled. The report will also display cancelled orders including limit orders as well as executed limit orders. This report may take several minutes to execute due to the volume and historical nature of this report.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - UK regulatory - Granular Timely Execution Report
500603|Report Category|The Fees and VAT report identifies transactions that are potentially value added tax (VAT) eligible for the purpose of verifying VAT was or was not correctly applied and reconciling the amounts collected to support remittance to HMRC on a periodic basis.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - VAT Charged Report
500603|Report Category|Intent of the report is to show the transactions that violated a particular Investment Compliance Rule and were overridden by a particular user. It should also display the Rule Name and Rule Type that caused the violation and the corresponding Accounts, and Portfolios. It should also display the Instrument and Transaction details along override details such as Overridden By, Overridden Date, and Override Reason of the person who overrode the violations. |User|Read-Only|BOXI - Investment Compliance Override Report
500603|Report Category|This report is used as an input to the firms fee, commission sharing process.  The firm is responsible for tracking the actual payments.  It is a snapshot of the current setup. |User|Read-Only|BOXI - Fee and Commission Sharing Report
