500737|Report Category|The U.K. Regulatory FCA Transaction Reconciliation(MiFIR)report details all transactions posted to SWP on a given day, and a determination if each transaction qualifies for reporting to the FCA. The report has been enhanced with new requirements to capture information like Investment Decision Maker where applicable and the person/system responsible for execution. The report also historically identifies if SWP successfully transmitted the transaction to FCA.(Most recent historical transactions view only)|User|Read-Only|BOXI-UK Regulatory-FCA Transaction Reconciliation (MiFIR) Report
500737|Report Category|This report is used to provide a complete picture of the MIFID Items processed for a day.This will include summary & detail data for qualifying & non-qualifying transactions processed,summary & detailed data on those MIFID items that were actually "reported" to FCA and whether they had any errors during the reporting process.This report can be used by operational users for daily operations & management for compliance reviews.Any UK role entitled to FP 6197 should also be entitled to FP 7303.|User|Read-Only|BOXI Report - MIFIR Transaction Reporting Control Report
