500670|Report Category|The Audit - Client Optional Fields Report will be used to report any  additions and/or changes to client optional fields during a time frame for a specific user or list of users, for a specific client or list of clients.  Note:  Changes to �Blank� or �Null� values will be treated as a "Modify" for purposes of the report.  First time specification of a value for the optional field will be treated as an "Add".|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Audit-Client Optional Fields Report
