500598|Report Category|This report will show changes to Client Owner Indicative Data that may highlight a need for firm to review their actual CRS Certification and/or FATCA Certification. For client owners (Primary and Joint) that have Certification updates, the report will show their certification status, date last updated and show if there were any changes to Client's indicative data such as Incorporation Country, Tax Jurisdiction, address for that client owner, phone number country code, passport countries, country of birth.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - UK Regulatory Reporting - Change in Circumstance
