500738|Report Category|The U.K. Regulatory FCA Transaction Reconciliation(MiFIR)report details all transactions posted to SWP on a given day, and a determination if each transaction qualifies for reporting to the FCA. The report has been enhanced with new requirements to capture information like Investment Decision Maker where applicable and the person/system responsible for execution. The report also historically identifies if SWP successfully transmitted the transaction to FCA.(Most recent historical transactions view only)|User|Read-Only|BOXI-UK Regulatory-FCA Transaction Reconciliation (MiFIR) Report
500738|Report Category|The UK Regulatory - FCA Transaction Reporting (SUP 17-MiFIR) Report details qualifying transactions sent to the FCA. It also details the validation response provided by the FCA ARM (UnaVista). Compliance Teams use the report to ensure SEI reports transactions timely and accurately. The report displays data sent to the FCA ARM (UnaVista). and data received from the FCA ARM (UnaVista).|User|Read-Only|BOXI - UK Regulatory FCA Transaction Reporting (SUP17-MiFIR)
