500738|Report Category|The Investment Guideline drift report displays the number of  "in balance and out of balance" entities (which could be portfolio, account, client or portfolio, account groups) at the investment guideline level. This would enable users to monitor drift at the asset classification level. This report is scheduled to run once a day and will calculate the drift for all entities for which at least one investment guideline is associated.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Investment Guideline Drift Summary Report
