500668|Report Category|The Corporate Actions Events Completed Report displays all CA event types that have been executed over a specified date period. The report is intended to be used by SEI Operations to monitor corporate action payments that have been made over a given period, and to compare the date the event was executed with the market announced Payable Date in order to validate service level standards.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Corporate Action Events Report
