500575|Report Category|This is a generic report containing all income and interest information regarding held assets including asset with or without active positions. A user will use this report for many purposes, each of which is related to understanding characteristics regarding assets and how would these be reflected on client statements for a given end date. One of the key purposes of this report is to assist in the review of dividend amounts, coupon rates and yield rates.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - EAI Yield Characteristics Report
