500669|Report Category|This report tracks order & execution timeliness for trades in mutual funds.User will be prompted to enter the appropriate time parameter they want the report to measure by.The SLA Y/N flags in this report don't take other factors such as market hours into account & times are calculated across business days only.All timestamps are returned for each trade ID resulting in multiple rows being displayed so user must apply any additional logic manually.The report will display cancelled orders and executed orders.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - UK Timely Order Report - Funds (UK Only)
