500598|Report Category|Intent of the report is to show the transactions that violated a particular Investment Compliance Rule and were overridden by a particular user. It should also display the Rule Name and Rule Type that caused the violation and the corresponding Accounts, and Portfolios. It should also display the Instrument and Transaction details along override details such as Overridden By, Overridden Date, and Override Reason of the person who overrode the violations. |User|Read-Only|BOXI - Investment Compliance Override Report
500598|Report Category|Post-Trade Compliance Validation of portfolio holdings against the Compliance rules enables portfolio managers and Compliance officers to actively monitor, analyze, and adjust the holdings found to be in violation.  This Report must inform users about any Investment Compliance Post Trade Validation Violations. It should also display the corresponding accounts, portfolios and positions.   |User|Read-Only|BOXI - Investment Compliance Post Trade Report
500598|Report Category|This report is used as an input to the firms fee, commission sharing process.  The firm is responsible for tracking the actual payments.  It is a snapshot of the current setup. |User|Read-Only|BOXI - Fee and Commission Sharing Report
