500598|Report Category|The Fee Approval report can be used to review periodic fee computations and collection activities for a firm.  The report has four tabs, the first for account computation activity, the second has the related account collection activities, the third is for Fee Group Computation information and the forth tab has Fee Group Collection activity.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Fee Approval Report
