500598|Report Category|Asset Characteristics - Mutual Funds report is a generic report containing information regarding subscribed assets for Mutual Fund securities.A user will employ this report for many purposes,each of which are related to understanding characteristics regarding Mutual Fund assets.The data available in this report reflects information found on the 'Funds' tab in the Asset Information page.This report is not intended to be used for client/account investment in an asset or to manage the asset maintenance process|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Asset Characteristics - Mutual Funds
500598|Report Category|The Audit - Client Optional Fields Report will be used to report any  additions and/or changes to client optional fields during a time frame for a specific user or list of users, for a specific client or list of clients.  Note:  Changes to �Blank� or �Null� values will be treated as a "Modify" for purposes of the report.  First time specification of a value for the optional field will be treated as an "Add".|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Audit-Client Optional Fields Report
500599|Report Category|The Corporate Actions Events Completed Report displays all CA event types that have been executed over a specified date period. The report is intended to be used by SEI Operations to monitor corporate action payments that have been made over a given period, and to compare the date the event was executed with the market announced Payable Date in order to validate service level standards.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Corporate Action Events Report
