500739|Report Category|This report is used to track the timeliness of market order executions. The report captures the elapsed time taken to execute the orders. The clock starts when the order is entered into GWP and stops when the order has been filled. The report will also display cancelled orders including limit orders as well as executed limit orders. This report may take several minutes to execute due to the volume and historical nature of this report.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - UK regulatory - Granular Timely Execution Report
500739|Report Category|The Corporate Actions Events Completed Report displays all CA event types that have been executed over a specified date period. The report is intended to be used by SEI Operations to monitor corporate action payments that have been made over a given period, and to compare the date the event was executed with the market announced Payable Date in order to validate service level standards.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Corporate Action Events Report
500739|Report Category|CUID = TBD|User|Read-Only|BOXI - Fee Profiles and Packages Report
