500740|Report Category|Audit - Account Characteristics report displays changes to basic Account information over a specified date range. Changes are grouped by category and subcategory and highlight the Who, What, When, and How (Add, Modify, Delete) of the changes. The intent is to provide the user insight into intraday static data changes made to Account attributes to support audit controls.|User|Read-Only|NEW Name:  BOXI - Audit - Account Characteristics
500740|Report Category|This report is used to track the timeliness of market order executions. The report captures the elapsed time taken to execute the orders. The clock starts when the order is entered into GWP and stops when the order has been filled. The report will also display cancelled orders including limit orders as well as executed limit orders. This report may take several minutes to execute due to the volume and historical nature of this report.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - UK regulatory - Granular Timely Execution Report
500740|Report Category|This report lists only One Time Fee activities scheduled for a future date.  Fees activities already processed or In Process will not be included in this report.|User|Read-Only|BOXI - One Time Fee Activity
500740|Report Category|Post-Trade Compliance Validation of portfolio holdings against the Compliance rules enables portfolio managers and Compliance officers to actively monitor, analyze, and adjust the holdings found to be in violation.  This Report must inform users about any Investment Compliance Post Trade Validation Violations. It should also display the corresponding accounts, portfolios and positions.   |User|Read-Only|BOXI - Investment Compliance Post Trade Report
